<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippines details 1997 Q1 GNP, GDP growth.</title>
<headline>Philippines details 1997 Q1 GNP, GDP growth.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Economic and Development Authority of the Philippines on Thursday announced gross national product (GNP) and gross domestic product (GDP) growth for the first quarter of 1997 as follows (all figures in percent):</p>
<p>				   Jan-Mar 1997	 Jan-Mar 1996</p>
<p>GNP				6.1		    6.9</p>
<p>Net Factor Income</p>
<p> From Abroad		  32.5		   75.5</p>
<p>GDP				5.0		    5.1</p>
<p>By Expenditure Share:</p>
<p>Personal consumption	 5.0		    4.2</p>
<p>Government consumption     4.0		    5.3</p>
<p>Investments		   10.3		   11.7</p>
<p>Exports			  7.4		   28.8</p>
<p>Imports			  9.8		   28.1</p>
<p>By Industrial Origin:</p>
<p>Agriculture, fisheries</p>
<p> and forestry		  3.8		    1.8</p>
<p>Industry			 3.8		    6.1</p>
<p>Services			 6.6		    6.1</p>
<p>-- Manila Newsroom (63 2) 8418939 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
